h are **not** verbatim contiguous source text. This is an open defect (see below).\\n\\n## Unresolved issues / blockers / open defects\\n1. **Quote correctness risk (high).** The three citation quotes in the staged file use `... {...}` elisions that do not appear in the original numbered lines; the requirement is a verbatim nonempty quote entirely contained in the cited range. Expected fix: replace with exact contiguous strings from `numbered_content` (N: stripped), e.g. range L25\u201328 containing `const filter = this.options.scope.scope(trigger)` and/or the `saveDisposition(trigger.id, { filtered: { code: filter.reason }, fanout: [], at })` / `return 'filtered'` fragments; L31\u201337 with e.g. `const keys = trigger.threads.map(threadKey)` and `thread.correlated = [...new Set([...thread.correlated, ...keys.filter(other => other !== thread.key)])]`; L42\u201345 with the exact `const followed = !!thread.context?.includes(ticketId)` plus its adjacent lines. Ranges must be re-checked so each quote lies fully inside its range.\\n2. Article not supplied \u2014 article-level comparison limited to README L3\u20135 characterisation; a fourth fixed-revision source would be needed for real article findings.\\n3. Only `intake.ts` from code; scope/liveness/ownership/util predicate definitions inferred from call sites.\\n4. Id-only dedupe blind to content-equivalent duplicates under new ids; whether other correlation exists is unknown from excerpt.\\n5. `pnpm check` documented only; no build/test/typecheck/runtime evidence for the revision.\\n6. **Router-facing structured delivery not yet submitted** in the required output_schema shape (summary/findings/decisions/artifacts/evidence_references/unresolved_issues/confidence/next_actions). A draft with those keys (confidence 0.78, receipt `receipt_5b451909d692`, sha `00e58f07...`, 11529 bytes) exists only as assistant text at ordinal 15 and is now **stale** \u2014 it predates the revision (current: 13698 bytes, sha `7c8f9e6ab491b3